c8e7eaceaf376df45a368d4603a7b43624ac05b8c85bfc59f8e3b4bd17e8cd", "domain": "nigerianlawguru.com", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T05:22:53.431138+00:00", "language": ""}, {"id": "1569", "title": "Contempt", "url": "https://nigerianlawguru.com/caselaw_digest/contempt/", "final_url": "https://nigerianlawguru.com/caselaw_digest/contempt/", "text": "Contempt Skip to content email: info@nigerianlawguru.cominfo@nigerianlawguru.com Phone: +2347066957900+2347066957900 Contact Us: Benin City, Nigeria Open Menu Home Our Team Articles Arbitration Commercial Law Company Law Constitutional Law Criminal Law and Procedure Customary Law and Procedure Family Law Environmental Law General Human Rights Law Insurance Intellectual Property Law International Law Jurisprudence Labour Law Maritime Law Oil and Gas Practice and Procedure Revenue Law Torts HOW TO TENDER AND PLAY VIDEO EVIDENCE IN COURT Caselaw Digest Legislations Constitutions of Nations Laws of the Federation of Nigeria Oil and Gas Legislations Rules Statutes Judgments Chieftaincy Matters Commercial Law Constitutional Law Criminal Law Customary Law Election Cases Environmental Law General Human Rights Law Insurance Law Labour Law Land Cases Matrimonial Cases Probate Matters Rulings Torts Law Forms and Precedents Legal Extras Blog Articles Top 7 Mistakes Every Personal Injury Lawyer Should Avoid in Their Career Contact Close Menu Generic selectors Exact matches only Search in title Search in content Post Type Selectors X Contempt June 3, 2024June 3, 2024| adminadmin| 0 Comment| 4:09 pm| Categories: Caselaw Digest CONTEMPTDownload Post navigation Previous Previous post: Next Next post: Related Posts June 3, 2024June 3, 2024 Interpretation ... Read MoreRead More June 3, 2024June 3, 2024 Laches ... Read MoreRead More June 3, 2024June 3, 2024 Confession ... Read MoreRead More SearchSearchRecent PostsEDO STATE CUSTOMARY COURTS LAW AMALACHUKWU O. IGWEOKOLO V. IGWENAGU OSITA CHRISTIAN IME NYA AKPAN V. EDIMA AKPAN OGHALE EMMANUEL USEH V. P